---
// 预渲染阶段没有真实边缘请求，cf 不可用；需按请求 SSR 才能读到国家
export const prerender = false;
import "../styles/global.css";
import { DEPLOY_SECRET } from "astro:env/server";
// import { DEPLOY_HOSTNAME } from "astro:env/server"; // error
import { env } from "cloudflare:workers";
const country = Astro.request.cf?.country;
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Astro</title>
	</head>
	<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 p-8 text-slate-100">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-sky-400">
			Astro + TypeScript + Tailwind
		</h1>
		<p
			class="mt-4 max-w-xl rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300"
		>
			<span class="font-semibold text-emerald-400"
				>astro:env DEPLOY_SECRET（server）</span
			>
			<br />
			<span class="mt-2 block text-base text-white">{DEPLOY_SECRET}</span>
		</p>
		<span class="mt-2 block text-base text-white"
			>wrangler DEPLOY_HOSTNAME env: <span class="text-emerald-400"
				>{env.DEPLOY_HOSTNAME}</span
			></span
		>
		<!-- <span class="mt-2 block text-base text-white"
			>astro DEPLOY_HOSTNAME env: <span class="text-emerald-400"
				>{DEPLOY_HOSTNAME}</span
			></span
		> -->
		your are from <span class="text-emerald-400">{country}</span>
	</body>
</html>
